  "bodyHtml": "\n\n\t\n\t\t<div class=\"archive-header\">\n\n\t<h1 class=\"archive-title\">Meet The Artist</h1>\n\n\t\n\t\n</div>\n\t\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t<article class=\"entry author-pwsbuilder has-excerpt post-4781 post type-post status-publish format-standard has-post-thumbnail category-meet-the-artist category-the-gallery category-gallery-artists category-news tag-meet-the-artist tag-sedona-summer tag-the-art-gallery-of-the-guild-of-harwich-artists\" id=\"post-4781\">\n\n\t\n\t\t<a href=\"/news/meet-the-artist-sedona-summer/\"><img class=\"landscape cw-greater thumbnail stargazer-full\" width=\"500\" height=\"500\" alt=\"Sedona summer coloring page.\" src=\"/media/archive/d15f63b1db2d25e8f070bb1c3614de447c80f0b6d2a9dd4e9f65a553e8044619.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\" /></a>\n\t\t<header class=\"entry-header\">\n\n\t\t\t<h2 class=\"entry-title\"><a href=\"/news/meet-the-artist-sedona-summer/\" rel=\"bookmark\">Meet The Artist Sedona Summer</a></h2>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"entry-byline\">\n\t\t\t\t<span class=\"entry-author\"><a href=\"/archive/source-37895d34f8cef391272c/\" rel=\"author\" class=\"url fn n\"><span>pwsbuilder</span></a></span>\n\t\t\t\t<time class=\"entry-published updated\" datetime=\"2019-11-19T20:02:36-05:00\" title=\"Tuesday, November 19, 2019, 8:02 pm\">November 19, 2019</time>\n\t\t\t\t<span class=\"comments-link\"></span>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\n\t\t</header>\n\n\t\t<div class=\"entry-summary\">\n\t\t\t<p>Sedona Summer will be featuring her children’s book, Spunky Sherry Sprite, the girl that loved to dance, at a Meet The Artist on December 7, 2019 from 1:00-4:00 p.m. at the Art Gallery of The Guild of Harwich Artists.</p>\n\t\t</div>\n\n\t\n</article>\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t<article class=\"entry author-pwsbuilder has-excerpt post-4647 post type-post status-publish format-standard has-post-thumbnail category-education category-events category-meet-the-artist category-the-gallery category-news tag-doris-mee tag-meet-the-artist\" id=\"post-4647\">\n\n\t\n\t\t<a href=\"/news/doris-mee-demonstrates/\"><img class=\"portrait cw-greater thumbnail stargazer-full\" width=\"386\" height=\"500\" alt=\"A painting of a woman in a hat.\" src=\"/media/archive/bd6a96c687809ec2e66169cb8005a0fcfa9af489416680e611c949dba9305726.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\" /></a>\n\t\t<header class=\"entry-header\">\n\n\t\t\t<h2 class=\"entry-title\"><a href=\"/news/doris-mee-demonstrates/\" rel=\"bookmark\">Doris Mee Demonstrates</a></h2>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"entry-byline\">\n\t\t\t\t<span class=\"entry-author\"><a href=\"/archive/source-37895d34f8cef391272c/\" rel=\"author\" class=\"url fn n\"><span>pwsbuilder</span></a></span>\n\t\t\t\t<time class=\"entry-published updated\" datetime=\"2019-08-05T21:14:35-04:00\" title=\"Monday, August 5, 2019, 9:14 pm\">August 5, 2019</time>\n\t\t\t\t<span class=\"comments-link\"></span>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\n\t\t</header>\n\n\t\t<div class=\"entry-summary\">\n\t\t\t<p>Free Artist Demonstration by Doris Mee – Saturday, August 17, 2:00 p.m. to 4 p.m. at the Art Gallery of the Guild of Harwich Artists, Harwich Port.</p>\n\t\t</div>\n\n\t\n</article>\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t<article class=\"entry author-pwsbuilder post-3947 post type-post status-publish format-standard has-post-thumbnail category-news tag-cape-cod tag-cape-cod-art-galleries tag-cape-cod-artist tag-harwich-ma tag-harwich-port tag-meet-the-artist tag-the-art-gallery-of-the-guild-of-harwich-artists\" id=\"post-3947\">\n\n\t\n\t\t<a href=\"/news/meet-the-artist-august-4/\"><img class=\"landscape cw-greater thumbnail stargazer-full\" width=\"640\" height=\"392\" alt=\"A picture of a teepee in a frame.\" src=\"/media/archive/e2325b07094631c7cfe0ba8a3e2febc6f3657fa559d9a197eb0c5621d263b66f.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\" /></a>\n\t\t<header class=\"entry-header\">\n\n\t\t\t<h2 class=\"entry-title\"><a href=\"/news/meet-the-artist-august-4/\" rel=\"bookmark\">Meet The Artist August 4</a></h2>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"entry-byline\">\n\t\t\t\t<span class=\"entry-author\"><a href=\"/archive/source-37895d34f8cef391272c/\" rel=\"author\" class=\"url fn n\"><span>pwsbuilder</span></a></span>\n\t\t\t\t<time class=\"entry-published updated\" datetime=\"2018-07-31T21:17:51-04:00\" title=\"Tuesday, July 31, 2018, 9:17 pm\">July 31, 2018</time>\n\t\t\t\t<span class=\"comments-link\"></span>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\n\t\t</header>\n\n\t\t<div class=\"entry-summary\">\n\t\t\t<p>Would you like to talk art with a master artist? Join Paul Hammersten who will spend the day, Saturday, August 4 discussing such questions as: What is art? Can creating <a href=\"/news/meet-the-artist-august-4/\" class=\"more-link\">[…]</a></p>\n\t\t</div>\n\n\t\n</article>\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t<article class=\"entry author-pwsbuilder post-3941 post type-post status-publish format-standard has-post-thumbnail category-news tag-cape-cod tag-cape-cod-art-galleries tag-harwich-ma tag-harwich-port tag-meet-the-artist tag-passport-to-the-arts tag-the-art-gallery-of-the-guild-of-harwich-artists\" id=\"post-3941\">\n\n\t\n\t\t<a href=\"/news/busy-saturday-in-harwich-port/\"><img class=\"portrait cw-greater thumbnail stargazer-full\" width=\"375\" height=\"500\" alt=\"Three women standing in front of a table with paints on it.\" src=\"/media/archive/bc8c17abbef9ade1c4bb8883a302263adaca3acf408992e7dd60fc16fd579e70.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\" /></a>\n\t\t<header class=\"entry-header\">\n\n\t\t\t<h2 class=\"entry-title\"><a href=\"/news/busy-saturday-in-harwich-port/\" rel=\"bookmark\">Busy Saturday in Harwich Port</a></h2>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"entry-byline\">\n\t\t\t\t<span class=\"entry-author\"><a href=\"/archive/source-37895d34f8cef391272c/\" rel=\"author\" class=\"url fn n\"><span>pwsbuilder</span></a></span>\n\t\t\t\t<time class=\"entry-published updated\" datetime=\"2018-07-23T14:37:13-04:00\" title=\"Monday, July 23, 2018, 2:37 pm\">July 23, 2018</time>\n\t\t\t\t<span class=\"comments-link\"></span>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\n\t\t</header>\n\n\t\t<div class=\"entry-summary\">\n\t\t\t<p>The Art Gallery of The Guild of Harwich Artists hosted “Meet The Artist” with Marion Harcourt on Saturday, July 21. The Art Gallery also held the afternoon reception for the <a href=\"/news/busy-saturday-in-harwich-port/\" class=\"more-link\">[…]</a></p>\n\t\t</div>\n\n\t\n</article>\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t<article class=\"entry author-pwsbuilder post-3920 post type-post status-publish format-standard category-education category-meet-the-artist category-the-gallery category-gallery-artists category-news tag-cape-cod-art-galleries tag-carl-wood tag-marion-harcourt tag-meet-the-artist\" id=\"post-3920\">\n\n\t\n\t\t<a href=\"/news/july-21-meet-the-artists/\"><img class=\"landscape cw-greater thumbnail stargazer-full\" width=\"691\" height=\"500\" alt=\"A watercolor painting of a river and marsh.\" src=\"/media/archive/d0b140abf08b684eb199eddf1625d89bb3abbb01999070733440f434e5522e1a.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\" /></a>\n\t\t<header class=\"entry-header\">\n\n\t\t\t<h2 class=\"entry-title\"><a href=\"/news/july-21-meet-the-artists/\" rel=\"bookmark\">July 21 Meet The Artists</a></h2>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"entry-byline\">\n\t\t\t\t<span class=\"entry-author\"><a href=\"/archive/source-37895d34f8cef391272c/\" rel=\"author\" class=\"url fn n\"><span>pwsbuilder</span></a></span>\n\t\t\t\t<time class=\"entry-published updated\" datetime=\"2018-07-10T11:32:41-04:00\" title=\"Tuesday, July 10, 2018, 11:32 am\">July 10, 2018</time>\n\t\t\t\t<span class=\"comments-link\"></span>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\n\t\t</header>\n\n\t\t<div class=\"entry-summary\">\n\t\t\t<p>Meet the Artists Marion Harcourt and Carl Wood for a free demonstration at the Art Gallery of the Guild of Harwich Artists from 2 to 4 PM on Saturday, July 21.  Marion will <a href=\"/news/july-21-meet-the-artists/\" class=\"more-link\">[…]</a></p>\n\t\t</div>\n\n\t\n</article>\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t<article class=\"entry author-pwsbuilder post-3907 post type-post status-publish format-standard catego